{"content_hash": "e48947c1b2cd8743", "version_id": 435, "article_id": 44, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "Fury-Joshua tickets sell out in one hour", "title_zh": "富里对约书亚拳赛门票一小时内售罄", "has_translation": true, "topic": "sports", "source": "bbc_sport", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/boxing/articles/cwp9gxzyplk4o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1788550545592-7e07d7846c76?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8ZnVyeSUyMHNwb3J0cyUyMGFjdGlvbnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzkxNTk0NTEyfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Daniel Delgado on Unsplash", "author": "Daniel Delgado", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@dannyd_91?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/people-grappling-in-jiu-jitsu-academy-x4A1siYHags?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(296, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(334, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SPORTS", "seed": "14d85ff3aedb"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-09", "word_count": 279, "reading_minutes": 1.4, "lead": "Tickets for the all-British heavyweight showdown between Tyson Fury and Anthony Joshua sold out within an hour of going on sale, with the most expensive seats priced at over £13,000.", "lead_zh": "泰森·富里与安东尼·约书亚的全英重量级对决门票开售后一小时内售罄，最贵座位票价超过1.3万英镑。", "preview": "Tickets for Tyson Fury and Anthony Joshua's heavyweight contest at Cardiff's Principality Stadium sold out in just one hour, with the highes", "preview_zh": "泰森·富里与安东尼·约书亚在加的夫公国体育场的重量级对决门票仅一小时内售罄，最高票价含手续费达13,128英镑，最低为88.50英镑。约8万张门票于周五英国夏令时12:00开售，几分钟内就有超过50万人在线排队。转售网站迅速挂出拳台边VIP座位，标价73,645英镑，上层看台座位", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 425, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/44/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 129.088, "size_bytes": 778320, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 325, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@0a373f3/content/data/versions/435.json", "paragraphs": ["Tickets for Tyson Fury and Anthony Joshua's heavyweight contest at Cardiff's Principality Stadium sold out in just one hour, with the highest-priced seats costing £13,128 including booking fees and the cheapest £88.50. Around 80,000 tickets went on sale at 12:00 BST on Friday, and within minutes more than 500,000 people were queuing online. Resale websites quickly listed ringside VIP seats at £73,645 and upper-tier seats at £425.", "The fight, broadcast globally on Netflix, will begin on 11 December, though the main event is not expected until the early hours of 12 December, with ringwalks around 01:00 GMT after a short live music performance. The stadium will remain open until 03:30. Promoted by Saudi boxing powerbroker Turki Alalshikh's The Ring and UFC chief Dana White, the event has yet to confirm any undercard fights.", "Joshua, 36, and Fury, 38, both former two-time world champions, signed contracts earlier this year, but the date and venue were only recently confirmed. London's Wembley Stadium and New York's Madison Square Garden were initially frontrunners, yet both posed logistical issues before Cardiff emerged as an alternative. The Principality Stadium has previously hosted late-night boxing, including Joe Calzaghe's 2007 bout with Mikkel Kessler.", "Just 11 days ago, uncertainty loomed over whether the fight would proceed due to a dispute over White's promotional role. Netflix said Alalshikh's The Ring and White would collaborate, but Joshua's promoter Eddie Hearn insisted his fighter's contract barred White from any promotional involvement. The British rivals finally met at a news conference on 30 September to launch the build-up to one of the most anticipated fights in British history. Fury and Joshua are reportedly sharing a purse worth close to $200m (£151m)."], "paragraphs_zh": ["泰森·富里与安东尼·约书亚在加的夫公国体育场的重量级对决门票仅一小时内售罄，最高票价含手续费达13,128英镑，最低为88.50英镑。约8万张门票于周五英国夏令时12:00开售，几分钟内就有超过50万人在线排队。转售网站迅速挂出拳台边VIP座位，标价73,645英镑，上层看台座位则要价425英镑。", "这场通过Netflix全球直播的比赛将于12月11日开始，但主赛预计要到12月12日凌晨才打响，拳手入场约在格林尼治时间01:00，之前有简短现场音乐表演。体育场将开放至03:30。赛事由沙特拳击权力经纪人图尔基·阿拉尔希赫的《拳台》杂志和UFC总裁达纳·怀特联合推广，但垫场赛尚未确认。", "36岁的约书亚和38岁的富里均为两届前世界冠军，今年早些时候已签署比赛合同，但日期和场地直到最近才敲定。伦敦温布利球场和纽约麦迪逊广场花园最初是热门候选，但两者都存在后勤问题，之后加的夫才作为替代方案出现。公国体育场此前曾举办过深夜拳赛，包括2007年乔·卡尔扎合与米克尔·凯斯勒的对决。", "就在11天前，由于怀特在推广中的角色引发争议，比赛能否举行尚存疑问。Netflix表示阿拉尔希赫的《拳台》将与怀特合作推广，但约书亚的推广人埃迪·赫恩坚称，其拳手合同禁止怀特参与任何推广活动。这对英国宿敌最终于9月30日召开新闻发布会，为这场英国历史上最受期待的比赛之一拉开序幕。据报道，富里和约书亚将分享接近2亿美元（1.51亿英镑）的奖金。"], "body": "Tickets for Tyson Fury and Anthony Joshua's heavyweight contest at Cardiff's Principality Stadium sold out in just one hour, with the highest-priced seats costing £13,128 including booking fees and the cheapest £88.50. Around 80,000 tickets went on sale at 12:00 BST on Friday, and within minutes more than 500,000 people were queuing online. Resale websites quickly listed ringside VIP seats at £73,645 and upper-tier seats at £425.\n\nThe fight, broadcast globally on Netflix, will begin on 11 December, though the main event is not expected until the early hours of 12 December, with ringwalks around 01:00 GMT after a short live music performance. The stadium will remain open until 03:30. Promoted by Saudi boxing powerbroker Turki Alalshikh's The Ring and UFC chief Dana White, the event has yet to confirm any undercard fights.\n\nJoshua, 36, and Fury, 38, both former two-time world champions, signed contracts earlier this year, but the date and venue were only recently confirmed. London's Wembley Stadium and New York's Madison Square Garden were initially frontrunners, yet both posed logistical issues before Cardiff emerged as an alternative. The Principality Stadium has previously hosted late-night boxing, including Joe Calzaghe's 2007 bout with Mikkel Kessler.\n\nJust 11 days ago, uncertainty loomed over whether the fight would proceed due to a dispute over White's promotional role. Netflix said Alalshikh's The Ring and White would collaborate, but Joshua's promoter Eddie Hearn insisted his fighter's contract barred White from any promotional involvement. The British rivals finally met at a news conference on 30 September to launch the build-up to one of the most anticipated fights in British history. Fury and Joshua are reportedly sharing a purse worth close to $200m (£151m).", "body_zh": "泰森·富里与安东尼·约书亚在加的夫公国体育场的重量级对决门票仅一小时内售罄，最高票价含手续费达13,128英镑，最低为88.50英镑。约8万张门票于周五英国夏令时12:00开售，几分钟内就有超过50万人在线排队。转售网站迅速挂出拳台边VIP座位，标价73,645英镑，上层看台座位则要价425英镑。\n\n这场通过Netflix全球直播的比赛将于12月11日开始，但主赛预计要到12月12日凌晨才打响，拳手入场约在格林尼治时间01:00，之前有简短现场音乐表演。体育场将开放至03:30。赛事由沙特拳击权力经纪人图尔基·阿拉尔希赫的《拳台》杂志和UFC总裁达纳·怀特联合推广，但垫场赛尚未确认。\n\n36岁的约书亚和38岁的富里均为两届前世界冠军，今年早些时候已签署比赛合同，但日期和场地直到最近才敲定。伦敦温布利球场和纽约麦迪逊广场花园最初是热门候选，但两者都存在后勤问题，之后加的夫才作为替代方案出现。公国体育场此前曾举办过深夜拳赛，包括2007年乔·卡尔扎合与米克尔·凯斯勒的对决。\n\n就在11天前，由于怀特在推广中的角色引发争议，比赛能否举行尚存疑问。Netflix表示阿拉尔希赫的《拳台》将与怀特合作推广，但约书亚的推广人埃迪·赫恩坚称，其拳手合同禁止怀特参与任何推广活动。这对英国宿敌最终于9月30日召开新闻发布会，为这场英国历史上最受期待的比赛之一拉开序幕。据报道，富里和约书亚将分享接近2亿美元（1.51亿英镑）的奖金。", "text": "Tickets for Tyson Fury and Anthony Joshua's heavyweight contest at Cardiff's Principality Stadium sold out in just one hour, with the highest-priced seats costing £13,128 including booking fees and the cheapest £88.50. Around 80,000 tickets went on sale at 12:00 BST on Friday, and within minutes more than 500,000 people were queuing online. Resale websites quickly listed ringside VIP seats at £73,645 and upper-tier seats at £425. The fight, broadcast globally on Netflix, will begin on 11 December, though the main event is not expected until the early hours of 12 December, with ringwalks around 01:00 GMT after a short live music performance. The stadium will remain open until 03:30. Promoted by Saudi boxing powerbroker Turki Alalshikh's The Ring and UFC chief Dana White, the event has yet to confirm any undercard fights. Joshua, 36, and Fury, 38, both former two-time world champions, signed contracts earlier this year, but the date and venue were only recently confirmed. London's Wembley Stadium and New York's Madison Square Garden were initially frontrunners, yet both posed logistical issues before Cardiff emerged as an alternative. The Principality Stadium has previously hosted late-night boxing, including Joe Calzaghe's 2007 bout with Mikkel Kessler. Just 11 days ago, uncertainty loomed over whether the fight would proceed due to a dispute over White's promotional role. Netflix said Alalshikh's The Ring and White would collaborate, but Joshua's promoter Eddie Hearn insisted his fighter's contract barred White from any promotional involvement. The British rivals finally met at a news conference on 30 September to launch the build-up to one of the most anticipated fights in British history. Fury and Joshua are reportedly sharing a purse worth close to $200m (£151m).", "vocab": [{"word": "showdown", "pos": "noun", "zh": "对决，决战", "note": "常用于体育或政治中，指关键性的较量。"}, {"word": "sell out", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "售罄", "note": "动词短语，指门票等全部卖完。"}, {"word": "purse", "pos": "noun", "zh": "奖金", "note": "拳击等比赛中指选手获得的总奖金。"}, {"word": "undercard", "pos": "noun", "zh": "垫场赛", "note": "主赛之前的辅助比赛。"}, {"word": "ringwalk", "pos": "noun", "zh": "拳手入场", "note": "拳击手从更衣室走向擂台的环节。"}, {"word": "powerbroker", "pos": "noun", "zh": "权力经纪人", "note": "在幕后有巨大影响力的人。"}, {"word": "frontrunner", "pos": "noun", "zh": "领跑者，热门候选", "note": "在竞争中最有可能获胜的人或事物。"}, {"word": "loom", "pos": "verb", "zh": "隐现，逼近", "note": "常指不祥之事即将发生。"}, {"word": "bar", "pos": "verb", "zh": "禁止，阻止", "note": "法律或规则上禁止某人做某事。"}, {"word": "collaborate", "pos": "verb", "zh": "合作", "note": "与某人一起工作以达成共同目标。"}, {"word": "promoter", "pos": "noun", "zh": "推广人", "note": "负责组织和宣传赛事的人。"}, {"word": "anticipated", "pos": "adj", "zh": "备受期待的", "note": "常与most连用，表示非常令人期待。"}, {"word": "controversy", "pos": "noun", "zh": "争议", "note": "公众对某事的激烈争论。"}, {"word": "logistical", "pos": "adj", "zh": "后勤的", "note": "涉及组织复杂活动所需的具体安排。"}], "title_original": "Fury-Joshua tickets priced up to £13,000 sell out in one hour", "summary_original": "Tickets for Tyson Fury and Anthony Joshua's fight at Cardiff's Principality Stadium sells out in just one hour.", "body_original": "Fury-Joshua tickets priced up to £13,000 sell out in one hour\nPublished\n9 October 2026\nTickets for Tyson Fury and Anthony Joshua's fight at Cardiff's Principality Stadium have sold out in just one hour.\nFury and Joshua will meet on a bill that begins on 11 December but they are not expected to fight until the early hours of 12 December.\nThe highest-priced tickets were available at £13,128, including booking fees, with the lowest at £88.50.\nThe all-British heavyweight contest, which will be broadcast globally on Netflix, was\nannounced in September\nand around 80,000 tickets went on sale at 12:00 BST on Friday.\nJust minutes after the tickets went on sale more than 500,000 people were waiting in the online queue.\nTickets quickly began emerging on resale websites, with ringside VIP seats being advertised for £73,645, while upper tier seats were available for £425.\nRingwalks are\nexpected to start around 01:00 GMT\non Saturday 12 December, following a short live music performance, and the stadium will remain open until 03:30.\nThe event is being promoted as a collaboration between Saudi boxing powerbroker Turki Alalshikh's The Ring and UFC chief Dana White.\nOrganisers are yet to confirm any of the undercard fights.\nWhat information do we collect from this quiz?\nJoshua, 36, and Fury, 38 - both former two-time world champions - signed contracts for the bout earlier this year, but the date and venue had yet to be confirmed.\nLondon's Wembley Stadium and New York's Madison Square Garden were the frontrunners to stage the fight, but both presented issues before Cardiff emerged as an alternative.\nThe Principality Stadium has hosted late-night boxing before, including Joe Calzaghe's fight with Mikkel Kessler in November 2007, which began at 01:00 GMT.\nRicky Hatton's victory over Kostya Tszyu at Manchester's MEN Arena in 2005 began at about 02:00 local time, allowing US broadcaster Showtime to show the fight on Saturday evening.\nJust 11 days ago, there was uncertainty over whether the fight would even take place due to a dispute over the role of UFC chief White in the promotion of the event.\nBroadcaster Netflix said Alalshikh's The Ring and White would collaborate to promote the event, but Joshua's promoter Eddie Hearn said his fighter's contract prevented White from having a promotional role.\nThe British rivals finally met at a news conference on 30 September to begin the build-up to one of the most anticipated fights in British history.\nFury and Joshua are reported to be sharing a purse worth close to $200m (£151m)\nRelated topics\nBoxing\nBoxing schedule and results 2026\nPublished\n1 day ago\nWatch every Born to Brawl episode\nPublished\n28 April 2024\nMore boxing from the BBC\nNotifications, social media and more with BBC Sport\nPublished\n28 August", "fetched_at": "2026-10-10T01:08:30.325164", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Tickets", "s": 0.1, "e": 0.525, "sm": 100, "em": 525, "cs": 0, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "for", "s": 0.537, "e": 0.675, "sm": 537, "em": 675, "cs": 8, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "Tyson", "s": 0.688, "e": 1.087, "sm": 687, "em": 1087, "cs": 12, "ce": 17, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "Fury", "s": 1.1, "e": 1.562, "sm": 1100, "em": 1562, "cs": 18, "ce": 22, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "and", "s": 1.575, "e": 1.787, "sm": 1575, "em": 1787, "cs": 23, "ce": 26, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "Anthony", "s": 1.8, "e": 2.225, "sm": 1800, "em": 2225, "cs": 27, "ce": 34, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "Joshua's", "s": 2.237, "e": 2.787, "sm": 2237, "em": 2787, "cs": 35, "ce": 43, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "heavyweight", "s": 2.8, "e": 3.3, "sm": 2800, "em": 3300, "cs": 44, "ce": 55, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "contest", "s": 3.312, "e": 3.938, "sm": 3312, "em": 3937, "cs": 56, "ce": 63, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": 